window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Secrets. Power. Peril.</b></p> <p>I'm the new girl on a scholarship at Crestmont University. I thought I had enough to deal with just keeping my grades up. But then I stumble into the orbit of the Crowned Syndicate, and suddenly, grades are the least of my worries.</p> <p>Callum Wakefield: the leader, enigmatic and seductive.</p> <p>Quentin Ravenscroft: Calum's twin—dark and brooding, suffering a world of pain.</p> <p>Thayer Pierce: the thief who hides a dark side that thrills me.</p> <p>Harrison Bennett: the hotel heir who covers his darkness behind a winning smile.</p> <p>They rule this place like a mafia, and I'm caught in their world now. It's dangerous, it's seductive, and it's a game where the stakes are life and death.</p> <p>I've got secrets of my own, and I'll need every one of them to survive the year. Welcome to the world of the Crowned Syndicate. It might just ruin me.</p> <p><i>This is a dark academia reverse harem for mature listeners. This takes place in an entirely fictional world set in the UK.</i></p>"; 
